<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30818" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶα</span></b> , an exclamation used to cheer or urge on,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on! up! away</i>! used
			with the imper. sg. or pl., cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				820
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶα δή</span>
			<i>come then</i>! <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1650
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				659
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶά νυν</span>
			<i>well now</i>! <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pax</u>
				467
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγ᾽ εἶα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					396
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ εἶα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					622
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				760
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ εἶα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					459
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶα ὦ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				468
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ εἶα δὴ . . σκεψώμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					239b
				</span></i>
			:—with interrog. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ</span>, where the question is equivalent to a command,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ εἶα . . δραμεῖσθε</span>; <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1423
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1597
			</span></i>. (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					87
				</span></i>
			, cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.495
			</span></i>.)</div>
